cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OntoForge in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "OntoForge: turn any codebase into a living business ontology"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chhabra
    given-names: Pravesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/prachh/ontoforge"
url: "https://prachh.github.io/ontoforge/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
keywords:
  - ontology
  - knowledge graph
  - code analysis
  - business rules
  - domain-driven design
  - OWL
  - software comprehension
  - LLM
abstract: >-
  OntoForge reads a codebase statically and builds a business ontology and code knowledge graph:
  domain concepts, business rules, lifecycles and code mappings, with optional LLM-generated
  definitions and rules, an OWL 2 RL reasoner, impact analysis, 2D/3D/VR visualisation and grounded chat.
